OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hopeful PC Harper killers
OL,4,Awill stay in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice leaders remain "optimistic" that
OL,7,Ftwo of PC Andrew Harper's killers will
OL,8,Fbe barred from securing an early
OL,9,Frelease from prison.
OL,11,FHarper, from Wallingford in
OL,12,FOxfordshire, died in August 2019 when
OL,13,Fhe was dragged by a car as three
OL,14,Fteenagers, including Albert Bowers and
OL,15,FJessie Cole, fled a quad bike theft in
OL,16,FBerkshire.
OL,18,FMore than one million people have
OL,19,Fsigned a petition calling for the pair
OL,20,Fto remain behind bars after it emerged
OL,21,Fthey could be released as part of a
OL,22,Fplan to reduce prison overcrowding.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
