OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hopeful PC Harper killers
OL,4,Awill stay in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior figures from Thames Valley
OL,7,FPolice met the justice secretary on
OL,8,FWednesday, and the government said he
OL,9,Fhad been tasked with keeping more
OL,10,Fserious offenders like them in prison
OL,11,Ffor longer.
